section6Body:
Under Brazil's General Data Protection Law (LGPD) and similar regulations, you have the right to:

• Confirm whether we process your data and access it;
• Correct incomplete, inaccurate or outdated data;
• Request deletion of your data;
• Know who we share your data with;
• Withdraw your consent at any time.

To exercise any of these rights, contact us at the email at the bottom of this page.
